# ==============================================================================
# PHASE 1: INTRO & OPENING PATH
# ==============================================================================
~ start
do GameManager.set_expression("normal")
Sienna: *Clad in a dark tank top, torn pants tied with a cloth sash, her wild spiky purple hair swinging as ear-fins twitch nervously.*
Sienna: *Her webbed clawed hands tap against the table as a wide grin lined with sharp white needle fangs flashes across her teal scaly face.*
Sienna: YO! Are you my date?! THAT IS LITERALLY SO WILD!
Sienna: Welcome to my bench! Don't mind the sea salt smell, it's just main character energy!

- "Your energy and style are incredible."
	do GameManager.add_affection("sea_monster", 10)
	if GameManager.get_affection("sea_monster") >= 70:
		do GameManager.set_expression("blush")
		Sienna: *Her ear-fins flare bright pink, webbed claws covering her needle-fang smile flusteredly.*
		Sienna: OMG STOP! You're literally gonna make my gills explode! You're so sweet!
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
		Sienna: *Laughs loudly, ear-fins wiggling with excitement.*
		Sienna: AYYYY! Finally, a date with elite taste! We're gonna have a total blast!
	=> hub_part_1

- "I noticed your webbed hands and purple hair."
	do GameManager.add_affection("sea_monster", 5)
	do GameManager.set_expression("happy")
	Sienna: *Shows off her webbed clawed hands, striking a punk rock pose.*
	Sienna: RIGHT?! Purple hair dye stays vibrant even two miles deep underwater! High fashion!
	=> hub_part_1

- "Could you talk a little quieter? You're screaming."
	do GameManager.add_affection("sea_monster", -10)
	if GameManager.get_affection("sea_monster") <= 0:
		=> horror_exit
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("angry")
		Sienna: *Her ear-fins droop slightly, crossing her webbed arms.*
		Sienna: Wow, okay... volume police! I'm just enthusiastic, no need to be a buzzkill!
		=> hub_part_1

- "You look chaotic. I don't trust sea monsters."
	do GameManager.add_affection("sea_monster", -25)
	if GameManager.get_affection("sea_monster") <= 0:
		=> horror_exit
	else:
		do GameManager.set_expression("scary")
		Sienna: *Her needle-fang jaw unhinges wider, neck gills flaring with an intimidating hiss.*
		Sienna: EXCUSE ME?! Watch your mouth, suitor, or I'll drag you into a trench!
		=> hub_part_1

# ==============================================================================
# PHASE 2: FIRST TOPIC LOOP (PART 1 - 4 TOPICS WITH FOLLOW-UP CHOICES)
# ==============================================================================
~ hub_part_1
if GameManager.get_affection("sea_monster") <= 0:
	=> horror_exit

do GameManager.set_expression("normal")

# Automatically progress to Phase 3 after completing all 4 Part 1 topics
if GameManager.has_flag("sea_monster", "asked_p1_topic_a") and GameManager.has_flag("sea_monster", "asked_p1_topic_b") and GameManager.has_flag("sea_monster", "asked_p1_topic_c") and GameManager.has_flag("sea_monster", "asked_p1_topic_d"):
	=> mid_date_interruption

Sienna: SO! What fun stuff are we talking about first?

- "Tell me about your deep-sea punk band!" [if not GameManager.has_flag("sea_monster", "asked_p1_topic_a")]
	=> p1_topic_a

- "What are your plans after leaving rehab?" [if not GameManager.has_flag("sea_monster", "asked_p1_topic_b")]
	=> p1_topic_b

- "Do you ever visit the beach up here?" [if not GameManager.has_flag("sea_monster", "asked_p1_topic_c")]
	=> p1_topic_c

- "Would you like a drink for the table?" [if not GameManager.has_flag("sea_monster", "asked_p1_topic_d")]
	=> p1_topic_d

